  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 8.2,
   "text": "Second, good check, checked, the same way that's point two spent, the limit reached."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.2,
   "end": 16.56,
   "text": "One more call and the contract says no before any money moves, over budget, refused, on the record."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.46,
   "end": 25.12,
   "text": "Balance untouched, one honest limit, this protects the buyer, not the seller, a dishonest buyer could still claim a failure."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.12,
   "end": 30.72,
   "text": "The buyer checks every receipt, the contract only pays on one the buyer has signed,"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.58,
   "end": 35.28,
   "text": "meated pay, failed call, deducted zero."
  }
